    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Master the Art of Oratory</p></blockquote><p>Adherents of the College of Eloquence master the art of oratory. These Bards wield a blend of logic and theatrical wordplay, winning over skeptics and detractors with reasoned arguments and plucking at heartstrings to sway the emotions of audiences.</p><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><h3>College of Eloquence Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.WqYRt606fBP6Qm6D]{Silver Tongue}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jAhczJtMd5nrw9ve]{Unsettling Words}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.zbj0k8B2hORHVEpg]{Unfailing Inspiration}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.uZ3PJGPOd5JEh0aY]{Universal Speech}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ETu8ZzXbnEfH1FhV]{Infectious Inspiration}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
